-- WoW Forever: live hotfix pushes from the 23 Nov 23:04 capture (client 71037). 114334, 114341 and 114345 came at login,
-- 114359 was pushed by live during play, and 114311 was sent again during play (it was missing here). What they change:
-- 114311: item 272432 (Pix Xizzix's vendor item) is now called Totem of the Maelstrom (was Totem of the Storm).
-- 114334: Deadwood Tribal Beads 263439 lose ITEM_FLAG_MULTI_DROP (each looter no longer gets a copy) and get ITEM_FLAG2_NO_VENDOR_VALUE.
-- 114341: QuestV2 98216, 98310, 98313 sent again (same as the client) and their QuestV2CliTask rows marked invalid.
-- 114345: Obsidian Sentinel's four items 274425, 274428, 274430, 274485 get ITEM_FLAG2_OVERRIDE_GOLD_COST and half the buy
--         and sell price; CreatureDifficulty 7023 marked invalid, CreatureDifficultyTreasure 97781 sent again (same as the client).
-- 114359: 31 Alterac Valley quest items (17306-18148) get ITEM_FLAG3_OBSOLETE; their TradeSkillItem rows sent again.
-- TradeSkillItem and CreatureDifficultyTreasure have no server table, so their records go out through hotfix_blob.
-- hotfix_data 2105951-2106180 (ours). Safe to run again.
